     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Fun is a Nature Sparsh play frame built on wooden posts, with a red slide, monkey bars, overhead rings and coloured climbers. Children climb in, swing along the bars and rings and slide out, so the frame gives a full circuit in a small area. It is made for ages 5 to 12 and takes up to 15 children. The product area is 16'6\" x 13'5\". Climbing, hanging, sliding and balancing build body strength, and the open layout leaves room for children to invent their own games. It comes in Cherry Red. We give a 3-year warranty on the galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Ask us to mark the safe zone for your site on a layout drawing."
     }
